Z||000001||Fformula88||02-14-2001||07:23 PM||||My father has a remanufactured engine in his 87 coupe.  Its not a Jasper engine, I think it may be a Precision, but am not positive.  Its been in the car a little over two years and there has been NO problems at all with it.  Its already logged 35,000 trouble free miles!  If reliability and longevity are a big concern, the remanufactured engines are a good buy.  Good luck!||||reg||1
