Z||000003||rogergarrison||02-15-2001||02:23 PM||||Jasper can make any mods to block and head you want while there doing it. I know a few guys that got quite a bit of custom work on thier Ford engines for Kit Cobras. 3.1 was only $1200=$1500 stock spec with unlimited warranty for I think 18 months. I dont have any connection anymore with them but they built and supplied 454 Chevys for my drag boat. Never any problems with them.||||reg||1
